  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Final Evaluation of Samoa&#xbf;s 11th EDF Civil Society Support Programme and 11th EDF Technical Cooperation Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objectives of this evaluation are to provide the relevant services of the European Union, the interested stakeholders and the wider public with:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7; an overall independent assessment of the performance of the &#xbf;11&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; EDF Civil Society Support Programme&#xbf; and &#xbf;11&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; EDF Technical Cooperation Facility&#xbf;&lt;em&gt;,&lt;/em&gt; paying particular attention to its different levels of results measured against its expected objectives; and the reasons underpinning such results; and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7; key lessons learned, conclusions and related recommendations in order to improve current and future interventions.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
